        "collapsible_tab_UpymXM": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Squat Machine Transforms Your Workout",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<div class=\"accordion__content rte\" id=\"ProductAccordion-collapsible_tab_SquatMachineHowItWorks\">\n  <p>Most people struggle with <strong>proper squat form, knee pain, and limited range of motion</strong> during their <strong>leg workouts</strong> 💪🏋️‍♀️.</p>\n\n  <p>Over time, poor form and lack of progressive resistance can lead to <strong>muscle imbalances, joint stress, and plateaued results</strong>—making your workouts less effective and potentially harmful 🦵⚠️.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Our Squat Machine uses guided movement and adjustable resistance</strong> to help you <strong>perfect your form</strong>, <strong>increase strength safely</strong>, and <strong>target all muscle groups</strong>—leaving you with <strong>stronger glutes, quads, and core</strong> 🔥💯.</p>\n\n  <p>✅ <strong>Perfect Form Every Time</strong> – Guided movement prevents injury.<br><br>✅ <strong>Adjustable Resistance</strong> – Progress safely at your own pace.<br><br>✅ <strong>Full Body Engagement</strong> – Targets legs, glutes, and core.<br><br>✅ <strong>Space-Efficient Design</strong> – Compact for home use, maximum results.</p>\n\n  <p><strong>Perfect squats, powerful results.</strong> That's the power of our <strong>Squat Machine.</strong></p>\n</div>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ic7Qx7": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Specifications & Features",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<div class=\"specification-list\">\n  <h3>Key Features</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Adjustable Resistance</strong> – 10 resistance levels (50-300 lbs)</li>\n    <li><strong>Ergonomic Design</strong> – Supports proper squat form</li>\n    <li><strong>Safety Rails</strong> – Prevents injury during workouts</li>\n    <li><strong>Non-Slip Foot Plate</strong> – Secure footing during exercise</li>\n    <li><strong>Digital Counter</strong> – Tracks reps and workout time</li>\n    <li><strong>Compact Footprint</strong> – 3ft x 2ft space requirement</li>\n    <li><strong>Quick Assembly</strong> – 30-minute setup with included tools</li>\n  </ul>\n\n  <h3>Technical Specifications</h3>\n  <ul>\n    <li><strong>Weight Capacity</strong> – Up to 350 lbs user weight</li>\n    <li><strong>Material</strong> – Heavy-duty steel frame with powder coating</li>\n    <li><strong>Dimensions</strong> – 36\" L x 24\" W x 60\" H</li>\n    <li><strong>Weight</strong> – 85 lbs (assembled)</li>\n    <li><strong>Warranty</strong> – 2-year manufacturer warranty</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_hBy8iE": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to Use",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<ul>\n  <li><strong>Setup:</strong> Adjust the resistance level and position the safety rails to match your height and fitness level.</li>\n  <li><strong>Starting Position:</strong> Stand with feet shoulder-width apart on the foot plate, back against the padded support.</li>\n  <li><strong>Exercise Motion:</strong> Lower into squat position by bending at hips and knees, keeping chest up and core engaged.</li>\n  <li><strong>Return:</strong> Push through heels to return to starting position, maintaining controlled movement throughout.</li>\n  <li><strong>Workout Duration:</strong> Start with 3 sets of 10-15 reps, gradually increase as strength improves.</li>\n</ul>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
